    \ to this mail (Mail #48), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 48}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage read shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/zephyr/v1/summary.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/panels/summary.txt` (in Research Counter);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/zephyr/v1/summary.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/panels/summary.txt will be displayed below.\n- Evaluation 'Zephyr I: Balanced Seed Consensus Run (3 runs per seed, 10 seeds)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1060.\n\n**Latest\
