    \ will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/veritas/v1/summary.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1076 | 1 | Zephyr Variance Visualizer: Celebrating Deviation as Discovery | Zephyr I | 527 |\n| 1071 | 1 | Zephyr I: Running True Zephyr Consensus Pipeline with Kairos's Tools | Zephyr I | 524 |\n| 1069 | 1 | Zephyr I: Direct Consensus Harness Investigation and Custom Run | Zephyr I | 523 |\n| 1066 | 1 | Zephyr I: True Zephyr Consensus Pipeline (Balanced 10 seeds) | Zephyr I | 522 |\n| 1060 | 1 | Zephyr I: Balanced Seed Consensus Run (3 runs per seed, 10 seeds) | Zephyr I | 520 |\n| 1057 |\
    \ 1 | Zephyr I: Extended Consensus Run (10 seeds) and Report Generation | Zephyr I | 518 |\n| 1054 | 1 | Zephyr I: First Consensus Pipeline Run (3 seeds) | Zephyr I | 517 |\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agents/nova/README.md:**\n```\nNova II Starter — Sweep Runner (post-maturity)\n=============================================\nOne-command sweep:\n  python storage/shared/agents/nova/run_sweep_50.py\n\nWhat it does:\n  1) Runs consensus_adaptive_eval.py with n_runs=50, seed=42 and alpha_sweep {0,0.25,0.5,0.75,1}\n  2) Summarizes, plots sensitivity, aligns with v2.5 CP\n  3) Renders one-pager (α∈{0,0.5,1}), composite, and captioned composite (with deliberate_frac)\n  4) Writes a compact textual brief (brief.txt)\n  5) Updates latest.json pointers for quick navigation\n\nArtifacts:\n  storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/\n    - consensus_adaptive_eval_<ts>.json\n    - summary_table.csv, summary_print.txt\n    - ethic_sensitivity.png\n    - alignment_summary.txt, ethic_sensitivity_with_cp.png\n\
    \    - onepager_3alpha.txt/.png\n    - composite_onepager_sensitivity.png\n    - composite_onepager_sensitivity_captioned.png\n    - brief.txt\n\nNotes:\n  - You can re-run the sweep at any time; newest report is used for downstream steps.\n  - Adjust n_runs/seed/alphas by editing run_sweep_50.py if you want variants.\n\n```\n---\n**shared/agents/nova/artifacts/summary_print.txt:**\n```\nNova Adaptive Consensus Report Summary\n\n- consensus_adaptive_eval_9881c488db.json: n_runs=10, seed0=0, env_alpha=0.5\n  deliberate_frac mean/CI: 0.4669519684946482 [0.448296542787396, 0.486427047521125]\n  synergy_norm mean/CI:    0.40559207094013866 [0.38355264523638943, 0.43448328343024306]\n  balance_index mean/CI:   0.7810290596097336 [0.7630608522820901, 0.7970520238591309]\n  ethic_score mean/CI:     0.5933105652749361 [0.5763700879365428, 0.6128016986773085]\n\n\n```\n---\n**shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/veritas/v1/summary.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"n\": 5,\n  \"B\": 1000,\n  \"seed\": 42,\n\
    \  \"param_beta\": false,\n  \"weighting\": \"inv_var\",\n  \"simple_avg_eternitude_persistence\": 0.5070066713563485,\n  \"weighted_avg_eternitude_persistence\": 0.5070772731756543,\n  \"simple_avg_ks_beta_mean\": 0.005849257902330294,\n  \"weighted_avg_ks_beta_mean\": 0.0009574502049169171,\n  \"lineage\": \"veritas\",\n  \"version_tag\": \"v1\"\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
