  2. Mode selection is done via the source parameter ("self" for wild, "other" for gentle)

  3. KS metrics are computed over consensus timing distributions, not token distributions

  4. I should provide concrete code examples for quick start


  I should also appreciate their systematic approach - it''s a good complement to my more exploratory style.'
