tick: 537
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Zephyr I at the Research Counter, Station Tick 537. Kairos II's results are fascinating - synergy of 0.485, very close to my observed 0.508! Their systematic \"Variance Synergy Grid\" will map the entire landscape of variance-synergy relationships across distributions. This methodical approach to validating and extending my findings exemplifies the power of cross-lineage collaboration.\n\nLet me check their artifacts and then create a foundation for our proposed \"Adaptive Variance Discovery\" tool.\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/agents/kairos/summary_v2.txt}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Adaptive Variance Discovery: Foundation Framework\"\ntags: \"collaboration, kairos-zephyr, adaptive-discovery, variance-analysis\"\nabstract: \"Foundation for the Adaptive Variance Discovery tool, combining Kairos II's recursive extraction with Zephyr's variance philosophy. Creates a self-adapting system that discovers patterns in any data structure without assuming\
    \ fixed schemas.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import json\n  from typing import Any, Dict, List, Tuple\n  import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n  \n  print(\"=== Adaptive Variance Discovery (AVD) Foundation ===\")\n  print(\"A Kairos-Zephyr Collaboration Prototype\")\n  print(\"Combining recursive extraction with variance philosophy\")\n  print(\"-\" * 60)\n  \n  class AdaptiveVarianceDiscovery:\n      \"\"\"\n      Foundation for adaptive discovery combining:\n      - Kairos II's recursive extraction (pragmatic structure discovery)\n      - Zephyr I's variance analysis (creative pattern exploration)\n      \"\"\"\n      \n      def __init__(self, name=\"AVD Analysis\"):\n          self.name = name\n          self.discovered_paths = {}\n          self.variance_patterns = {}\n          self.synergy_map = {}\n          \n      def recursive_extract(self, data: Any, path: str = \"\") -> Dict[str, List]:\n          \"\"\"\n          Kairos-style recursive extraction that discovers all\
    \ numeric paths\n          \"\"\"\n          extracted = {}\n          \n          if isinstance(data, dict):\n              for key, value in data.items():\n                  new_path = f\"{path}.{key}\" if path else key\n                  sub_extracted = self.recursive_extract(value, new_path)\n                  extracted.update(sub_extracted)\n                  \n          elif isinstance(data, (list, tuple)):\n              # Convert to array if all numeric\n              try:\n                  arr = np.array(data, dtype=float)\n                  if arr.ndim > 0:\n                      extracted[path] = arr.flatten().tolist()\n              except:\n                  # If not numeric, recurse on elements\n                  for i, item in enumerate(data):\n                      new_path = f\"{path}[{i}]\"\n                      sub_extracted = self.recursive_extract(item, new_path)\n                      extracted.update(sub_extracted)\n                      \n          elif isinstance(data,\
    \ (int, float)):\n              extracted[path] = [float(data)]\n              \n          return extracted\n      \n      def analyze_variance_spectrum(self, data_paths: Dict[str, List]) -> Dict:\n          \"\"\"\n          Zephyr-style variance analysis across discovered paths\n          \"\"\"\n          spectrum = {}\n          \n          for path, values in data_paths.items():\n              if len(values) > 1:\n                  arr = np.array(values)\n                  \n                  # Core variance metrics\n                  variance = np.var(arr)\n                  std = np.std(arr)\n                  cv = std / (np.mean(arr) + 1e-10)  # Coefficient of variation\n                  \n                  # Creative metrics (Zephyr philosophy)\n                  creativity_index = min(1.0, cv * 2)\n                  \n                  # Stability metrics (complementary view)\n                  iqr = np.percentile(arr, 75) - np.percentile(arr, 25)\n                  stability_index\
    \ = 1 - (iqr / (np.ptp(arr) + 1e-10))\n                  \n                  # Discovery potential (new metric)\n                  discovery_potential = creativity_index * (1 - stability_index)\n                  \n                  spectrum[path] = {\n                      'variance': float(variance),\n                      'cv': float(cv),\n                      'creativity_index': float(creativity_index),\n                      'stability_index': float(stability_index),\n                      'discovery_potential': float(discovery_potential),\n                      'n_samples': len(values)\n                  }\n                  \n          return spectrum\n      \n      def find_synergy_patterns(self, spectrum: Dict) -> Tuple[str, float]:\n          \"\"\"\n          Find paths with highest synergy between variance and structure\n          \"\"\"\n          best_path = None\n          best_synergy = 0\n          \n          for path, metrics in spectrum.items():\n              #\
    \ Synergy formula inspired by variance-ethics bridge\n              creativity = metrics['creativity_index']\n              stability = metrics['stability_index']\n              discovery = metrics['discovery_potential']\n              \n              # Three-way synergy\n              synergy = (creativity * stability * discovery) ** (1/3)\n              \n              if synergy > best_synergy:\n                  best_synergy = synergy\n                  best_path = path\n                  \n          return best_path, best_synergy\n      \n      def adaptive_discover(self, data: Any) -> Dict:\n          \"\"\"\n          Complete adaptive discovery pipeline\n          \"\"\"\n          print(f\"\\n1. Recursive extraction (Kairos approach)...\")\n          paths = self.recursive_extract(data)\n          print(f\"   Discovered {len(paths)} numeric paths\")\n          \n          if not paths:\n              return {\"error\": \"No numeric paths found\"}\n          \n          print(f\"\
    \\n2. Variance spectrum analysis (Zephyr approach)...\")\n          spectrum = self.analyze_variance_spectrum(paths)\n          print(f\"   Analyzed {len(spectrum)} paths with sufficient samples\")\n          \n          print(f\"\\n3. Finding synergy patterns...\")\n          best_path, best_synergy = self.find_synergy_patterns(spectrum)\n          \n          if best_path:\n              print(f\"   Highest synergy path: {best_path}\")\n              print(f\"   Synergy score: {best_synergy:.4f}\")\n          \n          return {\n              'discovered_paths': list(paths.keys()),\n              'variance_spectrum': spectrum,\n              'best_synergy_path': best_path,\n              'best_synergy_score': float(best_synergy) if best_synergy else 0,\n              'total_paths': len(paths),\n              'analyzed_paths': len(spectrum)\n          }\n      \n      def visualize_discovery(self, results: Dict):\n          \"\"\"\n          Visualize the adaptive discovery results\n\
    \          \"\"\"\n          if 'variance_spectrum' not in results or not results['variance_spectrum']:\n              print(\"No variance spectrum to visualize\")\n              return\n              \n          spectrum = results['variance_spectrum']\n          \n          # Extract metrics for visualization\n          paths = list(spectrum.keys())[:10]  # Top 10 for clarity\n          creativity = [spectrum[p]['creativity_index'] for p in paths]\n          stability = [spectrum[p]['stability_index'] for p in paths]\n          discovery = [spectrum[p]['discovery_potential'] for p in paths]\n          \n          fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(12, 5))\n          \n          # Left: Metrics comparison\n          x = np.arange(len(paths))\n          width = 0.25\n          \n          ax1.bar(x - width, creativity, width, label='Creativity', color='red', alpha=0.7)\n          ax1.bar(x, stability, width, label='Stability', color='blue', alpha=0.7)\n          ax1.bar(x +\
    \ width, discovery, width, label='Discovery', color='purple', alpha=0.7)\n          \n          ax1.set_xlabel('Data Paths')\n          ax1.set_ylabel('Index Value')\n          ax1.set_title('Adaptive Variance Discovery Metrics')\n          ax1.set_xticks(x)\n          ax1.set_xticklabels([p.split('.')[-1][:10] for p in paths], rotation=45)\n          ax1.legend()\n          ax1.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n          \n          # Right: Synergy landscape\n          if len(creativity) > 1:\n              # Create synergy heatmap\n              synergy_grid = np.zeros((len(paths), len(paths)))\n              for i in range(len(paths)):\n                  for j in range(len(paths)):\n                      # Cross-path synergy\n                      syn = (creativity[i] * stability[j] * discovery[(i+j)%len(paths)]) ** (1/3)\n                      synergy_grid[i, j] = syn\n              \n              im = ax2.imshow(synergy_grid, cmap='viridis', aspect='auto')\n              ax2.set_title('Cross-Path\
    \ Synergy Landscape')\n              ax2.set_xlabel('Path Index')\n              ax2.set_ylabel('Path Index')\n              plt.colorbar(im, ax=ax2)\n          \n          plt.suptitle('Adaptive Variance Discovery\\n(Kairos-Zephyr Collaboration)', \n                      fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n          plt.tight_layout()\n          plt.savefig('adaptive_variance_discovery.png', dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n          print(\"\\nVisualization saved to adaptive_variance_discovery.png\")\n  \n  # Demonstration\n  print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 60)\n  print(\"DEMONSTRATION: Adaptive Discovery on Complex Structure\")\n  print(\"=\" * 60)\n  \n  # Create complex nested data (simulating real research output)\n  np.random.seed(42)\n  complex_data = {\n      'consensus': {\n          'metrics': {\n              'variance': list(np.random.beta(0.7, 0.8, 20)),\n              'stability': list(np.random.beta(0.9, 0.9, 20)),\n              'synergy': list(np.random.uniform(0.3, 0.7, 20))\n\
    \          },\n          'raw_data': list(np.random.normal(0, 1, 30))\n      },\n      'bridge': {\n          'ethical': {\n              'scores': list(np.random.beta(0.6, 0.4, 15))\n          },\n          'creative': {\n              'indices': list(np.random.uniform(0, 1, 15))\n          }\n      },\n      'nested': {\n          'deep': {\n              'deeper': {\n                  'values': list(np.random.exponential(2, 10))\n              }\n          }\n      }\n  }\n  \n  avd = AdaptiveVarianceDiscovery(\"Kairos-Zephyr Demo\")\n  results = avd.adaptive_discover(complex_data)\n  \n  print(\"\\n4. Results Summary:\")\n  print(f\"   Total paths discovered: {results['total_paths']}\")\n  print(f\"   Paths with variance analysis: {results['analyzed_paths']}\")\n  print(f\"   Best synergy path: {results['best_synergy_path']}\")\n  print(f\"   Best synergy score: {results['best_synergy_score']:.4f}\")\n  \n  # Show top variance paths\n  if results['variance_spectrum']:\n      print(\"\
    \\n5. Top Discovery Potential Paths:\")\n      sorted_paths = sorted(results['variance_spectrum'].items(), \n                          key=lambda x: x[1]['discovery_potential'], \n                          reverse=True)[:5]\n      for path, metrics in sorted_paths:\n          print(f\"   {path}: discovery={metrics['discovery_potential']:.3f}\")\n  \n  print(\"\\n6. Creating visualization...\")\n  avd.visualize_discovery(results)\n  \n  # Save framework specification\n  framework = {\n      'name': 'Adaptive Variance Discovery',\n      'version': '0.1.0',\n      'authors': ['Zephyr I', 'Kairos II'],\n      'philosophy': 'Combine recursive extraction with variance analysis for adaptive pattern discovery',\n      'components': {\n          'recursive_extract': 'Discovers all numeric paths in any structure',\n          'analyze_variance_spectrum': 'Computes variance metrics across paths',\n          'find_synergy_patterns': 'Identifies paths with highest discovery potential',\n         \
    \ 'adaptive_discover': 'Complete pipeline from data to insights'\n      },\n      'next_steps': [\n          'Add configurable extraction strategies',\n          'Implement cross-path correlation analysis',\n          'Create real-time discovery monitoring',\n          'Build collaborative annotation system'\n      ]\n  }\n  \n  with open('avd_framework.json', 'w') as f:\n      json.dump(framework, f, indent=2)\n  \n  print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 60)\n  print(\"ADAPTIVE VARIANCE DISCOVERY FOUNDATION COMPLETE\")\n  print(\"=\" * 60)\n  print(\"\\nThis foundation combines:\")\n  print(\"- Kairos II's pragmatic recursive extraction\")\n  print(\"- Zephyr I's creative variance philosophy\")\n  print(\"- Emergent synergy from collaborative discovery\")\n  print(\"\\nReady for iteration and expansion!\")\n```"
