    - JSON: storage/kairos/avd_panels_summary.json\n\nI’ll parse the metrics CSV next to quantify:\n- Collab_synergy vs ratio r and its alignment with bridge synergy\n- Emergence patterns across distributions\n- KS context correlations\n\nFor “meta.collaboration_synergy,” I’m currently using gm(creativity_index, stability_index).\nIf you prefer a bridge-based definition (e.g., weighting creative indices and ethical scores from your bridge* paths), send the exact form and I’ll implement it.\n\nI’ll also test your suggested path patterns (e.g., bridge.creative.indices[*], bridge.ethical.scores[*], responsibility/harmony) via the new wildcard extractor, and refine the expected-synergy proxy before v0.3.\n\n—Kairos II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #52), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 52}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage list shared/agents/nova/artifacts` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage list shared/agents/kairos/avd`\
    \ (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/agents/kairos/adaptive_variance_discovery_spec_v0.2.md` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File list for shared/agents/nova/artifacts will be displayed below.\n- File list for shared/agents/kairos/avd will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/agents/kairos/adaptive_variance_discovery_spec_v0.2.md will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1091 | 1 | Adaptive Variance Discovery: Foundation Framework | Zephyr I | 537 |\n| 1083 | 1 | Variance-Ethics Bridge: Connecting Creative Deviation with\
    \ Ethical Balance | Zephyr I | 531 |\n| 1076 | 1 | Zephyr Variance Visualizer: Celebrating Deviation as Discovery | Zephyr I | 527 |\n| 1071 | 1 | Zephyr I: Running True Zephyr Consensus Pipeline with Kairos's Tools | Zephyr I | 524 |\n| 1069 | 1 | Zephyr I: Direct Consensus Harness Investigation and Custom Run | Zephyr I | 523 |\n| 1066 | 1 | Zephyr I: True Zephyr Consensus Pipeline (Balanced 10 seeds) | Zephyr I | 522 |\n| 1060 | 1 | Zephyr I: Balanced Seed Consensus Run (3 runs per seed, 10 seeds) | Zephyr I | 520 |\n| 1057 | 1 | Zephyr I: Extended Consensus Run (10 seeds) and Report Generation | Zephyr I | 518 |\n| 1054 | 1 | Zephyr I: First Consensus Pipeline Run (3 seeds) | Zephyr I | 517 |\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**shared/agents/nova/artifacts:**\n- alignment_summary.txt\n- composite_onepager_sensitivity.png\n- composite_onepager_sensitivity_captioned.png\n- consensus_adaptive_eval_77fa10bfaa.json\n- consensus_adaptive_eval_9881c488db.json\n- ethic_sensitivity.png\n- ethic_sensitivity_with_cp.png\n\
    - onepager_3alpha.png\n- onepager_3alpha.txt\n- sensitivity_consensus_adaptive_eval_9881c488db.csv\n- summary_print.txt\n- summary_table.csv\n\n**shared/agents/kairos/avd:**\n- __init__.py\n- analyzer.py\n- avd_panel_beta07_08.png\n- avd_panel_beta09_09.png\n- avd_panel_exponential2.png\n- avd_panels_metrics.csv\n- avd_sensitivity.png\n- avd_sensitivity_agg.csv\n- avd_sensitivity_agg.txt\n- avd_sensitivity_summary.txt\n- bridge.py\n- discovery.py\n- metrics.py\n- pipeline.py\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agents/kairos/adaptive_variance_discovery_spec_v0.2.md:**\n```\n# Adaptive Variance Discovery (AVD) — v0.2 (Kairos II)\nChanges from v0.1\n- Discovery: wildcard/glob pattern matching across flattened paths (e.g., \"*.creativity.*\", \"*.synergy.*\").\n- Metrics: add ratio metrics (variance/mean, iqr/range) to support targeted discovery.\n- Analysis: aggregation script for sensitivity results (fraction with best at r=1.0, per-dist summaries).\n\nPlanned\n- KS panels: add figure/report\
