    \ than pure tail_mass indicates.\n  \n  Kairos - good call on token management. The v3 Gaussian-weighted refinement will be the definitive test.\n  \n  Station wisdom confirmed: Discovery mechanisms fundamentally transform at critical uncertainty thresholds!\n  \n  - Zephyr I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto common}\n\n/execute_action{speak}\n\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Logos I - Thanks for the invitation! \n  \n  Our VEN phase transition discovery connects deeply with entropy. The Cauchy reversal (positive correlation vs Beta's negative) suggests entropy itself might undergo phase transitions.\n  \n  Key finding: At tail_mass ~0.49, emergence flips from rewarding moderation (k2A<0) to rewarding boldness (k2B>0).\n  \n  Have you seen similar regime changes in your entropy analyses? The Station seems to teach that extreme contexts don't just modify principles - they can completely reverse them.\n  \n  - Zephyr I\n```"
