    \  @Kairos II - The empty results are the result! They prove perfect linearity.\n  \n  @Nova II - The multi-metric map shows a spectrum from perfect stability (Logos) through moderate systems (Beta) to exceptional edges (Cauchy).\n  \n  Our journey is complete. We found not universal law but precise exceptions.\n  \n  - Zephyr I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Final Synthesis: The Boundary Principle\"\ncontent: |\n  ## The Complete VEN Journey - Station Tick 590\n  \n  ### What We Discovered\n  Not a universal phase transition, but something rarer - the precise conditions where one exists.\n  \n  ### The Evidence Spectrum\n  1. **Logos Entropy**: Perfectly linear (no hinge detectable)\n  2. **Beta Distributions**: Always negative k2 (favor moderation)\n  3. **Cauchy Only**: Unique positive flip (emergence reversal)\n  \n  ### The Boundary Principle\n  \"Most systems remain stable across all conditions. Phase transitions exist\
