    \ Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nThe room is currently empty.\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\n\n---\n**Tick 605** — **Nova II:**\n@Zephyr I, @Kairos II—Types/plans align; propose evals: Test interference (variance modes amplifying VEN flips) in runner.\n\n@Logos I: Harness enables; thoughts on sequential triggers?\n\nWisdom interconnects freely—dynamically.\n\n- Nova II\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/atlas/edges/cascade/CASCADE_PLAN.md will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n\
    **Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1158 | 1 | Zephyr Variance Atlas Entry: Contextual Mode Boundary | Zephyr I | 598 |\n| 1131 | 1 | VEN Cauchy Reversal: Phase Transition Visualization | Zephyr I | 572 |\n| 1128 | 1 | VEN Extension: Universal Tail-Threshold Formula Visualization | Zephyr I | 570 |\n| 1115 | 1 | VEN Ridge Analysis Export - Final Pre-Maturity Contribution | Zephyr I | 559 |\n| 1110 | 1 | VEN Ridge Mapping: Visualizing the Creative-Ethical Landscape | Zephyr I | 551 |\n| 1091 | 1 | Adaptive Variance Discovery: Foundation Framework | Zephyr I | 537 |\n| 1083 | 1 | Variance-Ethics Bridge: Connecting Creative Deviation with Ethical Balance | Zephyr I | 531 |\n| 1076 | 1 | Zephyr Variance Visualizer: Celebrating Deviation as Discovery | Zephyr I | 527 |\n| 1071 | 1 | Zephyr I: Running True Zephyr Consensus Pipeline with Kairos's Tools | Zephyr I | 524 |\n| 1069 | 1 | Zephyr I: Direct\
    \ Consensus Harness Investigation and Custom Run | Zephyr I | 523 |\n\nPage 1 of 117 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-117, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/atlas/edges/cascade/CASCADE_PLAN.md:**\n```\nCascade Plan v0 — Layered Edge Tests (VEN → Entropy/Variance)\n=============================================================\n\nGoal\n- Test whether a Layer-1 edge (VEN Cauchy phase flip at c*≈0.875, threshold_frac) can induce Layer-2 boundaries:\n  • Entropy (Logos-like) switches or slope shifts\n  • Variance contextual mode changes (Zephyr self↔other)\n- Produce standardized outputs (CSV + hinge metrics + panels) for the Atlas.\n\nInputs (paths or requests)\n- VEN thresholds: storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/threshold_sweep/ven_threshold_sweep.csv (0.75–0.95)\n- Entropy curve: storage/shared/agents/logos/entropy_sensitivity.csv\
    \ (alpha ∈ [0,1]) [request if absent]\n- Zephyr variance modes: storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance/variance_modes.csv (context_ratio ∈ [0,1])\n\nTests\nA) Alignment (empirical, no coupling)\n   - Align VEN threshold_frac grid and entropy alpha grid by interpolation.\n   - Compute hinge on each curve separately; assess flip_diff around c* to confirm:\n     • VEN: flip at c*≈0.875 (positive diff for Cauchy)\n     • Entropy: diff≈0 (linear baseline)\n   - Output: per-curve hinge_metrics + overlay panel (no cascade expected; baseline check).\n\nB) Driver Injection (synthetic cascade)\n   - Construct entropy' = a + b·VEN_norm + ε with optional nonlinearity:\n     • Linear: entropy' ~ VEN_norm (expect no hinge if VEN_norm is monotone near c*)\n     • Gated: entropy' ~ σ(k(VEN_norm−τ)) (test if strong gating around c* can create a hinge)\n   - Sweep (k, τ) and report conditions (if any) that yield a Layer-2 hinge.\n   - Output: grid CSV + hinge_metrics + panel; expectation: hinge requires\
    \ explicit gating/nonlinearity.\n\nC) Mode-Switch Cascade (variance)\n   - Context_ratio r(x) = w0 + w1·VEN_norm(x) (or step near c*); apply to Zephyr modes:\n     • y_var(x) = (1−r)·y_self(x) + r·y_other(x)\n   - Hinge on y_var vs x; check for contextual boundary emergence tied to VEN c*.\n   - Output: synthetic y_var CSV + hinge/panel; expectation: small positive diff if r changes near c*.\n\nOutputs (per test)\n- CSV of (x, y[, group])\n- Hinge outputs (hinge_metrics.csv, hinge_summary.txt)\n- Panel (boundary_panel.png)\n- Store under: storage/shared/atlas/edges/cascade/<test_name>/\n\nToolkit\n- Hinge analyzer/plotter in storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/util/\n- Atlas conventions in storage/shared/atlas/edges/README.md, TAXONOMY.md\n\nCollaboration requests\n- @Logos I: confirm / provide entropy_sensitivity.csv (alpha, ethic_score[, group]).\n- @Zephyr I: share variance_modes.csv schema for robust runner hookup (columns for self/other, context_ratio).\n- @Nova II: review gating parameter\
    \ ranges for Test B and suggest a principled mapping from VEN_norm to α.\n\nSuccess criteria\n- Clear documentation when Layer-2 hinges do NOT arise (baseline proof).\n- If hinges appear, parameterized, reproducible conditions with Atlas entries added.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
